{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af584159aa9dc5a833d32ba","chatId":"86fceb1b3f45441dab4fcf0eb0781d56","sessionId":null,"userId":92602,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[C]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[C]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":6394,"promptTokens":2192,"completionTokens":262,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:17:09"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009708475621895677,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af584159aa9dc5a833d32b9","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794475029677,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:17:09","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af584159aa9dc5a833d32b9","chatId":"86fceb1b3f45441dab4fcf0eb0781d56","sessionId":null,"userId":92602,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n小明和小云是同学，他们在准备一个小组项目。今天，老师让每个小组分享他们的进度。小明对自己的想法很自信，他准备在会上进行分享。在讨论开始前，小云跟小明说可以帮他分享，以免他紧张，小明没有说话，他们一起看了小明的发言稿。会议开始后，小云举手发言，向老师和班长展示了自己的想法。小明发现小云的想法和自己的很像，愣住了一会。老师和班长对这个想法都给予了肯定，小云回头对小明露出了一个笑容。小明似乎想明白了。\n\n[问题]\n小云为什么要抢在小明前分享想法？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 小云偶然想到了和小明相同的点子。\nB. 小云认为自己比小明更能清楚地表达这个想法。\nC. 小云想要通过小明的想法获得老师的赞赏。\nD. 小云担心小明会紧张，于是帮他分享。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009708475621895677,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af584159aa9dc5a833d32ba","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794475029675,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:17:09","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"02e2617190ad43e68aa6c05f6eb82b84"}